managed_file.description:
File: {path}

{error}

Correct the file and call occupied.reload or wait for change detection. The last valid running program is retained; an invalid initial file puts the controller in Error.

invalid_program.description:
Controller: {name}

{error}

The original program is preserved and management is stopped. Open Occupied Settings, correct the preserved YAML, and save a valid program to resume management.
